<title>USA: Consumers Water Co Q1 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Consumers Water Co Q1 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Maine 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.01   profit	 $0.21</p>
<p> Net loss			53   profit	 1,824</p>
<p> Revs			22,931		   21,902</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,771		    8,547</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 net income from continuing operations was a profit of $1.8 million, or $0.21 per share, vs a profit of $1.9 million, or $0.22 per share, for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Included in Q1 1996 net income figure were gains totaling $917,000 from sale of properties. Included in Q1 1997 figure was a $326,000 loss on sale of property.</p>
</text>
